# Placeholder (...) evaluation: forces an UnimplementedError (E081).
# $try catches the error and returns Variant(Result.Error, message-string).
# This tests that ... is properly lazy — the error only fires when the thunk is forced
# inside the zero-argument function passed to try.
[try [fn [] ...]]
=== out
Variant(Result.Error, Dict({"msg": String("placeholder `...` was evaluated — replace with an implementation")}))
